@* anasayfa *@

<!-- ÜST FOTO -->
<div class="text-center mb-4">
    <img src="~/images/pudingli_cilekli_pastajpg.jpg"
         class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-width:1500px;" />
</div>

<!-- ALTTA 3 CARD -->
<div class="container">
    <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card" style="background-color: #e1bee7;">
                <img src="~/images/pasta.jpg" class="card-img-top" />
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p class="fst-italic">
                        "The bottom layer of this cake, positioned in the foreground and surrounded by fresh raspberries and a white lattice pattern covered with a red glaze, is the definition of elegance. The dense chocolate layer on top, meanwhile, appeals to those who love the depth of bitter chocolate.

                        This meticulously crafted design offers not only a taste but also a feast for the eyes. It is the perfect finale for a luxurious celebration or an unforgettable dinner."
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card" style="background-color: #e1bee7;">
                <img src="~/images/orman.jpg" class="card-img-top" />
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p class="fst-italic">
                        "It's impossible to resist the invitation of this cake, which shimmers as if straight out of a fairy tale, bathed in the magical light peacefully streaming through the depths of the forest. The rustic texture of the rich white cream, prepared with quality ingredients, and the warm color of the cake layers offer a natural elegance.

                        This presentation, set upon a mossy log, whispers to us that this cake is more than just a dessert; it is a return to nature and a peaceful journey toward happiness."
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card" style="background-color: #e1bee7;">
                <img src="~/images/mor.jpg" class="card-img-top" />
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p class="fst-italic">
                        "It’s impossible to resist the invitation of this cake, which shines like a work of art under the warm sunlight streaming through the window. The deep purple hue of its cream, prepared with high-quality ingredients, and the rich sauce dripping down its sides add an appetizing richness.

                        The fresh and glossy blackberries, along with the mint leaves on top, provide a finish that is as eye-catching as it is delicious. This cake is not just a dessert; it is a journey to happiness."
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>


<h1>Ürün İçerikleri</h1>



<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h1 style="text-align:left; font-size:22px;">
                🍰 Our Ingredients: The Secret to Taste Lies in Fresh and Quality Contents!
            </h1>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                Every single product prepared in our patisserie not only offers a wonderful taste but also carries the assurance that it is made with the highest quality and freshest ingredients. We meticulously select the contents we use in our kitchen, prioritizing your and your loved ones' health and pleasure.
            </p>

            <h1 style="text-align:left; font-size:22px;">
                ✨ Why Our Ingredients Make a Difference?
            </h1>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                Natural and Fresh Produce: We source our fruits seasonally and our vegetables fresh from local producers. The vibrant and authentic flavor in our pastries comes from their natural state.
            </p>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                Quality Chocolate and Cocoa: We exclusively use the best chocolates with a high cocoa content. This allows us to offer a rich, deep, and melt-in-your-mouth taste experience.
            </p>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                Real Milk and Butter: The creamy texture and rich flavor of our products come from natural, additive-free milk-derived butter and cream. We prioritize using 100% real butter instead of margarine.
            </p>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                Carefully Selected Flour and Eggs: We always prefer specialized flour blends that yield the best results and fresh, free-range eggs, such as farm eggs. This ensures our cakes and baked goods rise perfectly and are wonderfully soft.
            </p>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                Say No to Preservatives and Artificial Colorings: We create our flavors using entirely natural methods, without the use of artificial additives, preservatives, or synthetic colorings.
            </p>

            <h1 style="text-align:left; font-size:22px;">
                💖 Sensitivity to Special Needs
            </h1>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                We also consider our guests with allergies or those following special diets. We offer gluten-free options, vegan recipes, and refined sugar-free alternatives in many of our products. You can always request detailed information about our product ingredients on the product pages of our website or from our staff in the patisserie.
            </p>
            <p style="padding-left:35px;">
                We work every day with the same initial excitement to offer you the most natural and enjoyable tastes, without ever compromising on quality. That wonderful scent you feel the moment you walk through our patisserie doors is the best proof of the freshness of our ingredients!
            </p>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>
